[API] Updates ml.infer_trained_model path

/_ml/trained_models/{model_id}/deployment/_infer is deprecated since
version 8.2.0. The code has been updates to use
/_ml/trained_models/{model_id}/_infer instead. The response object is
different and will return:

{
  "inference_results":
  [
    {"predicted_value": [[1.0,1.0]]}
  ]
}

Instead of:
{"predicted_value": [[1.0,1.0]]}
